col	cirislens.federation_attestations	20	promoted_at	timestamp with time zone	false					v4.4 (CIRISPersist#171) — set by attestation_promote at the local→federation transition (the federation-emit moment). NULL for natively-federation rows and un-promoted local rows. Persist-internal — NOT part of the JCS canonical signing bytes (CEG §10.1.5.3 must #2).	
col	cirislens.federation_attestations	21	additional_scrubs	text	true	'[]'::text				v24.0.0 (CIRISPersist#556) — JSON array of the 2nd..Nth ScrubSig entries over the SAME canonical attestation_envelope as the base scrub. Empty array = single-scrub row (wire-absent, persist_row_hash unchanged).	
col	cirislens.federation_attestations	22	dimension	text	false	((attestation_envelope)::jsonb ->> 'dimension'::text)	s				
