col	cirislens.federation_blobs	13	author_key_id	text	false					#846 (BLOB_REPLICATION.md §5) — the attesting_key_id of the attestation this blob is a projection of: the writer's DERIVED federation key id for a local write (I23), the declared provenance for an adopted one. NULL = unknown, which is_proxy_content treats as proxy (fail toward evictable). Not backfilled: no pre-V144 row records its author.	
col	cirislens.federation_blobs	14	key_grant_emitted_at	timestamp with time zone	false					When this node last emitted the blob's content-axis KeyGrant set; NULL or not later than the newest at-rest grant means DIRTY (CIRISPersist#848, §14).	
col	cirislens.federation_blobs	15	group_key_id	text	false					#984 (rows 1 and 4) — the group the write named: the owner identity (self), the family key (family) or the community key, as the scoped doors received it. NULL = unknown (pre-V177, adopted, or a write that named no group). The retroactive-ADD walk joins on it and excludes NULL (fail-secure); durability resolves a family blob's audience from it. Not backfilled: no pre-V177 row records its group.	
