rel	cirisgraph.consolidation_locks	r	p			v0.8.2 (CIRISPersist#36) — per-(period_start, tenant_id) lock for the TSDB rollup. Acquired via INSERT…ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING; stale locks (>1h since locked_at) auto-break per AV-53.
rel	cirisgraph.edges	r	p			v0.8.0 (CIRISPersist#34) — directed typed edges between nodes. No FK on source/target so eventual-consistency writes work; k-hop CTE tolerates dangling edges. (edge_id) is the PK (UUID); the (source, target, relationship) tuple may repeat across different windows / weights.
rel	cirisgraph.nodes	r	p			v0.8.0 (CIRISPersist#34) — typed graph nodes absorbed from CIRISAgent LocalGraphMemoryService. Schema mirrors agent column shape for parity; persist adds audit envelope (signature / signing_key_id / signature_verified / original_content_hash / persist_row_hash). PK is (node_id, scope) — same id may exist in multiple scopes without collision.
rel	cirisgraph.telemetry_metrics	r	p			v0.8.2 (CIRISPersist#36) — raw telemetry observations (24h-lived). Rolled up every 6h into tsdb_summary nodes in cirisgraph.nodes; raw rows deleted after rollup. No per-row audit envelope (ephemeral); rolled-up summary carries the audit path.
rel	cirislens.accord_active_halt	r	p		{ciris=arwdDxt/ciris,cirislens_reader=r/ciris}	
