rel	cirislens.scheduled_tasks	r	p		{ciris=arwdDxt/ciris,cirislens_reader=r/ciris}	v1.5.12 (CIRISPersist#59 #4) — scheduled tasks substrate. Absorbs CIRISAgent ciris_engine.db.scheduled_tasks. Status vocabulary is UPPERCASE (PENDING/ACTIVE/COMPLETE/FAILED). FK to cirislens.thoughts DEFERRABLE.
rel	cirislens.service_correlations	r	p		{ciris=arwdDxt/ciris,cirislens_reader=r/ciris}	v1.5.11 (CIRISPersist#59 #3) — service correlations substrate. Absorbs CIRISAgent ciris_engine.db.service_correlations. Dual-purpose: service-interaction tracking + TSDB metrics + distributed-trace spans + logs. correlation_type column discriminates between sub-shapes.
