rel	cirislens_secrets.master_key_meta	r	p			v0.6.1 (CIRISPersist#19) — master-key lifecycle. rotate_master_key INSERTS a new row; reencrypt_all activates it; old key gets deactivated_at + rotated_to set.
rel	cirislens_secrets.secrets	r	p			v0.6.1 (CIRISPersist#19) — encrypted-secrets store. AES-256-GCM via src/secrets/crypto.rs facade. Federated SecretsServiceProtocol substrate.
